#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:1
msgid "软件候选与物理资格"
msgstr "Software candidates and physical qualification"

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:3
msgid ""
"平台机制已经实现，当前 [开发验证记录](verification.md) 说明真实执行的范围。 **最终 clean-source SDK／离线双构建／候选封存与物理 HIL "
"是独立阶段**，不能因 代码完成、CI 定义或某个 hash 存在就记录为 passed。"
msgstr ""
"Platform mechanisms are implemented; current [development verification](verification.md) describes"
" actual execution scope. **Final clean-source SDK, offline double-build, candidate sealing and "
"physical HIL are separate stages**. Code completion, CI definitions or a hash cannot establish "
"passed status."

