#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:16
msgid ""
"HIL fixture 和 station template 位于 `tools/hil/fixtures/`。空 station、错误 "
"Board/PCB/芯片／probe／image/config、失效工具文件或不完整预算会被准入拒绝。 准备工装不等于已经刷写、串口测试、测量波形或完成掉电试验。"
msgstr ""
"HIL fixtures and station templates are in `tools/hil/fixtures/`. Admission rejects empty stations,"
" incorrect Board/PCB/chip/probe/image/config, invalid tool files or incomplete budgets. Preparing "
"fixtures is not flashing, serial testing, waveform measurement or completed power-cut testing."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:20
msgid ""
"本轮新增 ThreadX、USB FS、浅睡眠 timebase、Ethernet、高级 timer、G474 和 user I/O broker，以及 H743／U575 GPIO/UART "
"参考装配的证据各自绑定独立 source scope。ThreadX 的真实 Linux 内核 执行不同于 IRQ/libc 边界模型；三板 BASEPRI/PRIMASK ELF 和缺少 "
"external Tick 的 精准负链接不同于 MCU 运行。安装 SDK 的 retention-only 永久任务程序只建立链接； 有限退出的真实 Linux kernel consumer"
" 另外建立运行证据。不能从链接程序的存在 推断已运行 scheduler，也不能从两个 host case 推断完整 MCU backend 资格。"
msgstr ""
"Evidence for ThreadX, USB FS, shallow-sleep timebase, Ethernet, advanced timers, G474, the user "
"I/O broker and H743/U575 GPIO/UART references is each bound to independent source scope. Real "
"ThreadX Linux-kernel execution differs from IRQ/libc boundary models. Three-board BASEPRI/PRIMASK "
"ELFs and exact negative links for absent external Tick differ from MCU execution. The installed "
"SDK retention-only permanent-task program establishes linking only; a separately executed bounded-"
"exit real Linux-kernel consumer establishes runtime evidence. A linked program does not imply "
"scheduler execution, and two host cases do not imply complete MCU-backend qualification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:28
msgid ""
"八个公开单镜像候选配置使用 H743 HSI64／Cache off 和 U575 MSIS4 MHz／ TZEN=0／SWAP_BANK=0。H743 的 HSI32／Cache on "
"固定配置及有限 TX DMA、U575 独立 TZEN=1 双域参考另有各自软件与 ARM 证据，不属于这八个候选配置。 模型和 ELF 不会观察实际供电、option bytes 或 "
"silicon revision；per-engine DMA facts 本身也不建立实际 cache coherence 或安全域隔离。SDK 必须实际用 当前完整 source "
"closure 构建 H743/U575 公共 consumer；只加入 CMSIS dependency 的旧包资格不能继承为新增平台资格。精确结果见 [SoC 扩展执行记录](soc-"
"extensions-verification.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The eight public single-image candidate configurations use H743 HSI64/Cache off and U575 MSIS4 "
"MHz/TZEN=0/SWAP_BANK=0. H743 HSI32/Cache-on fixed configuration and limited TX DMA, and the "
"independent U575 TZEN=1 split-domain reference, have separate software/ARM evidence and are "
"outside those eight candidates. Models and ELFs do not observe actual power, option bytes or "
"silicon revision. Per-engine DMA facts alone establish neither actual cache coherence nor "
"security-domain isolation. The SDK must actually build H743/U575 public consumers from the current"
" complete source closure; qualification of an old package that only added CMSIS dependencies "
"cannot qualify new platforms. Exact results are in [SoC extension execution](soc-extensions-"
"verification.md)."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:37
msgid ""
"G474 已有真实 typed factory 主机执行、system/provider/EXTI 回归及显式 TOML ARM 镜像（empty／selected／EXTI fixture × "
"裸机／FreeRTOS）。EXTI fixture 的 PA0/PA1 是软件接线夹具，未获得 PCB 电气资格。镜像预算、操作表保留、未选 外设裁剪及实际向量字节分别检查；SysTick 的 "
"170 MHz／1 kHz／reload169999 是编译配置与链接证明，不是时间精度测量。主机 sanitizer 只检查被执行的软件 路径。参考配置的晶振／PCB／焊桥、硬件时序、同最终 "
"clean HEAD 的 SDK／离线 复现与新候选有各自退出条件，不能据此把 G474 的其他外设或 ThreadX 记为支持。"
msgstr ""
"G474 has actual typed-factory host execution, system/provider/EXTI regressions and explicit TOML "
"ARM images (empty/selected/EXTI fixture × baremetal/FreeRTOS). EXTI-fixture PA0/PA1 are software "
"wiring fixtures without PCB electrical qualification. Image budgets, operation-table retention, "
"unselected-peripheral trimming and actual vector bytes are checked separately. SysTick 170 MHz/1 "
"kHz/reload169999 is compilation/link evidence, not timing-precision measurement. Host sanitizers "
"only check executed software paths. Reference crystal/PCB/solder bridges, hardware timing and "
"final-clean-HEAD SDK/offline reproduction/new candidates have separate exit conditions; other G474"
" peripherals or ThreadX cannot be marked supported from this evidence."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:45
msgid ""
"USB 的 packet/clock/factory 模型与软件 Board ELF 不提供 VBUS、connector、PHY、 enumeration 或 flush 周期的物理证明。浅 "
"Sleep 的 1 MHz timer 模型只建立被执行 的量化相位合同，真实 clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/功耗要用同一镜像测量。Ethernet descriptor"
" OWN/loan、capture/break 与 caller memory pin 的软件模型同样不能 建立电气、吞吐、边沿孔径、功率级安全或 MPU/TZ userspace 隔离。公共 "
"API、模式 配置、SoC provider、reviewed Board route、最终候选与物理执行是不同退出条件。"
msgstr ""
"USB packet/clock/factory models and software-Board ELFs do not physically prove VBUS, connector, "
"PHY, enumeration or flush cycles. The shallow-Sleep 1 MHz timer model establishes only the "
"executed quantization-phase contract; actual clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/power require measurement"
" on the same image. Ethernet descriptor OWN/loan, capture/break and caller-memory-pin software "
"models likewise establish no electrical, throughput, edge-aperture, power-stage safety or MPU/TZ "
"userspace isolation. Public API, mode configuration, SoC provider, reviewed Board route, final "
"candidate and physical execution have different exit conditions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:52
msgid ""
"可返回任务只有真实 kernel detach 后才归还存储；prestart discard 只属于已证明 的启动前 scope。scheduler 启动尝试后返回是 retaining "
"fail-stop，不能将内核 返回值解释为从未启动，或撤销可能已经运行的任务、DMA、时钟和外部效果。 停止 I/O 后仍运行的内核继续保留 clock/Tick；产品 reset、设备 "
"safe outputs 和 完整 scheduler-stop port 是外部责任。平台不做自动故障恢复或安全认证声明。"
msgstr ""
"Returning tasks release storage only after actual kernel detach. Prestart discard applies only to "
"proven prestart scope. A scheduler-start attempt that returns is a retaining fail-stop; kernel "
"return cannot mean never started or revoke tasks, DMA, clocks and external effects that may have "
"run. A kernel still running after I/O stop retains clock/Tick. Product reset, safe device outputs "
"and a complete scheduler-stop port are external responsibilities. The platform claims no automatic"
" fault recovery or safety certification."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:58
msgid ""
"Core 的 `nx_fault_observe` 是无默认状态的 best-effort 观察窄端口。FreeRTOS 和 ThreadX 在 retaining fail-stop "
"路径提供实际 domain/reason/静态源码位置，然后仍 保留全部借用。故障上下文可能已 masked、ISR、unprivileged 或 stack 损坏，观察者 不能假定工作中的 "
"kernel/clock/transport，也不能释放借用、加 OS lock 或重放 请求。hook 返回仍继续停机；fault log、外部 safe output 与受控 reset "
"分别验收， 不能由 host death test 推断实板异常处理和安全输出已经运行。"
msgstr ""
"Core `nx_fault_observe` is a best-effort observation narrow port with no default state. "
"FreeRTOS/ThreadX retaining fail-stop paths supply actual domain/reason/static source position and "
"retain all borrows. Fault context may be masked, ISR, unprivileged or stack-corrupted. Observers "
"cannot assume a working kernel/clock/transport, release borrows, take OS locks or replay requests."
" Returning hooks still proceed with halt. Fault logging, external safe output and controlled reset"
" are separately accepted; host death tests do not imply executed physical exception handling or "
"safe outputs."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:65
msgid ""
"最终候选包应保留准确原始命令、退出码、JUnit／model／预算与 binary 身份，支持 再次校验。给当前源码补一份介绍文档不会继承过去的测试资格；源码或产物变化需 重新执行适用检查。普通 "
"CI 与 source SDK workflow 也不自动完成产品 promotion。"
msgstr ""
"Final candidate packages retain exact raw commands, exit codes, JUnit/model/budget and binary "
"identities for revalidation. Adding introductory documentation does not inherit past test "
"qualification; changed source/artifacts require applicable checks to run again. Ordinary CI and "
"source-SDK workflows do not automatically promote products."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:69
msgid ""
"实板接入后优先复核安全输出、clock/reset、UART TC/cancel/RX loss、SPI/I2C、Flash 掉电、watchdog、EXTI/PWM/ADC，再测 "
"cycles/latency/high-water 与长期负载。私有 产品策略、现场部署、密钥与制造许可由外部工程承接。"
msgstr ""
"After hardware connection, first check safe outputs, clock/reset, UART TC/cancel/RX loss, SPI/I2C,"
" Flash power cuts, watchdog and EXTI/PWM/ADC; then measure cycles/latency/high-water and sustained"
" load. External projects own private product policies, field deployment, keys and manufacturing "
"permissions."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/qualification.md:73
msgid ""
"实施台账的 `implemented` 记录代码与工具已经落入源码； `qualification_record_authority` 表示实际验收由该源码 HEAD 的外部交付证据决定。 "
"它不在源码中自报 passed。正式执行写入 `nexus-delivery/<HEAD>/`，候选的 `candidate.json`、六类 qualification "
"和原始报告一起给出最终状态。 这样提交后的验收能绑定准确 HEAD，后续文档提交也不能继承旧资格。"
msgstr ""
"Ledger `implemented` records that code/tools exist in source. `qualification_record_authority` "
"means actual acceptance is determined by external delivery evidence for that source HEAD, not "
"self-reported passed status in source. Formal execution writes to `nexus-delivery/<HEAD>/`; "
"candidate `candidate.json`, six qualification classes and raw reports together determine final "
"status. Post-commit acceptance can thus bind exact HEAD, and later documentation commits cannot "
"inherit old qualification."
